{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309610","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309610","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130961001:1":{"text":"探検者たちを見てみろ。長い間苦労して探したのに、結局何も見つからなかった。それどころか、怪我した人もいるだろう……心が痛むよ。","source_cn":"你看那些寻宝者，辛辛苦苦找了这么久，最后却一无所获，说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10068291E410DEEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130961002:1":{"text":"それに比べれば、考古調査の方がまだ信憑性がある！","source_cn":"相比起来，还是考古更有保障！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C088899854EFDD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130961003:1":{"text":"少なくとも、協会が指定する派遣先には歴史的な遺跡があることは確かだし、安全性もある程度は確保されている。","source_cn":"至少，协会派我们来的地方都确定会有历史遗迹，周围也没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A7823CD635E9613","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130961004:1":{"text":"頑張って研究を進めれば、自ずと成果はついてくる！","source_cn":"只要我们认真研究，总不至于半点收获也没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33660A5CE6313256","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:学者朱利安":{"text":"学者のジュリアン","source":"学者朱利安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}